  "description": "A name included on the Peutinger map. The \"Graaei\" were a Paeonian tribe whose territory was located on the Strymon River. Scholars debate whether this name should be correlated with the archaeological site of Terpni/Nigrita, a place located 21 kilometers southeast of Kalokastro.",
